width":601},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":11,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":39,"from":12,"to":90,"x":0}],[{"y":63,"from":90,"to":177,"x":0}],[{"y":87,"from":177,"to":263,"x":0}],[{"y":111,"from":263,"to":270,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":135,"from":271,"to":271,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":159,"from":272,"to":282,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":183,"from":283,"to":363,"x":0}],[{"y":207,"from":363,"to":444,"x":0}],[{"y":231,"from":444,"to":530,"x":0}],[{"y":255,"from":530,"to":539,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":279,"from":540,"to":540,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":303,"from":541,"to":549,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":327,"from":550,"to":628,"x":0}],[{"y":351,"from":628,"to":712,"x":0}],[{"y":375,"from":712,"to":795,"x":0}],[{"y":399,"from":795,"to":825,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":423,"from":826,"to":826,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":447,"from":827,"to":836,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":471,"from":837,"to":918,"x":0}],[{"y":495,"from":918,"to":1003,"x":0}],[{"y":519,"from":1003,"to":1078,"x":0}],[{"y":543,"from":1078,"to":1102,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":567,"from":1103,"to":1103,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":591,"from":1104,"to":1115,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":615,"from":1116,"to":1199,"x":0}],[{"y":639,"from":1199,"to":1280,"x":0}],[{"y":663,"from":1280,"to":1361,"x":0}],[{"y":687,"from":1361,"to":1393,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"•\tReceptor:\nPersona, grupo o unidad organizacional que recibe el mensaje, lo decodifica e interpreta a partir de sus conocimientos previos, sus expectativas y el contexto en el que se encuentra. La comprensión que logre puede diferir de la intención original del emisor.\n\n•\tMensaje:\nContenido que se transmite en el proceso comunicativo, que puede incluir ideas, instrucciones, emociones o decisiones. Su efectividad depende de la claridad con que se construye, la coherencia interna y la pertinencia frente a las necesidades del receptor.\n\n•\tCanal:\nMedio a través del cual el emisor transmite el mensaje al receptor. Puede ser presencial (reunión, conversación), escrito (correo, circular, memorando) o digital (plataforma colaborativa, videollamada). La elección del canal incide directamente en la calidad del intercambio.\n\n•\tCódigo:\nSistema de signos, lenguajes y convenciones compartidas que permiten codificar y decodificar el mensaje. Comprende el lenguaje verbal oral y escrito, los gestos, las expresiones y los símbolos institucionales que emisor y receptor conocen y comparten en su entorno.\n\n•\tContexto:\nCondiciones físicas, culturales, temporales y emocionales en las que se desarrolla el intercambio comunicativo. Determina cómo se emite e interpreta el mensaje: un mismo enunciado puede adquirir significados distintos según el momento, el lugar o la relación entre los actores."}},{"type":"text","name":"•\tFunción reguladora: orienta el comportamiento de los integrantes de la organización mediante el establecimiento y la difusión de normas, políticas, procedimientos y manuales. Asegura que las decisiones y acciones individuales sean coherentes con los está","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintLeft":true,"constraintWidth":true,"constraintHeight":true,"constraintBottom":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":1295,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}]}},"id":"e6e8ec51-a196-461e-89ba-2b26814320d7","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-8676,"ty":-8706},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":543},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":67,"x":0}],[{"y":39,"from":67,"to":139,"x":0}],[{"y":63,"from":139,"to":206,"x":0}],[{"y":87,"from":206,"to":281,"x":0}],[{"y":111,"from":281,"to":330,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":135,"from":331,"to":331,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":159,"from":332,"to":332,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":183,"from":333,"to":333,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":207,"from":334,"to":334,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":231,"from":335,"to":335,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":255,"from":336,"to":336,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":279,"from":337,"to":337,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":303,"from":338,"to":338,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":327,"from":339,"to":339,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":351,"from":340,"to":340,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":375,"from":341,"to":407,"x":0}],[{"y":399,"from":407,"to":483,"x":0}],[{"y":423,"from":483,"to":554,"x":0}],[{"y":447,"from":554,"to":634,"x":0}],[{"y":471,"from":634,"to":673,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":495,"from":674,"to":674,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":519,"from":675,"to":675,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":543,"from":676,"to":676,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":567,"from":677,"to":677,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":591,"from":678,"to":678,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":615,"from":679,"to":679,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":639,"from":680,"to":680,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":663,"from":681,"to":746,"x":0}],[{"y":687,"from":746,"to":815,"x":0}],[{"y":711,"from":815,"to":888,"x":0}],[{"y":735,"from":888,"to":958,"x":0}],[{"y":759,"from":958,"to":991,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":783,"from":992,"to":992,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":807,"from":993,"to":993,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":831,"from":994,"to":994,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":855,"from":995,"to":995,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":879,"from":996,"to":996,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":903,"from":997,"to":997,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":927,"from":998,"to":998,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":951,"from":999,"to":999,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":975,"from":1000,"to":1000,"x":0}]]},{"lines":[[{"y":999,"from":1001,"to":1071,"x":0}],[{"y":1023,"from":1071,"to":1134,"x":0}],[{"y":1047,"from":1134,"to":1202,"x":0}],[{"y":1071,"from":1202,"to":1273,"x":0}],[{"y":1095,"from":1273,"to":1320,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"•\tFunción reguladora: orienta el comportamiento de los integrantes de la organización mediante el establecimiento y la difusión de normas, políticas, procedimientos y manuales. Asegura que las decisiones y acciones individuales sean coherentes con los estándares institucionales y contribuyan al logro de los objetivos colectivos.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n•\tFunción motivadora: contribuye a generar compromiso, sentido de propósito y reconocimiento en los integrantes de la organización. Cuando la comunicación explica el significado del trabajo, reconoce los logros y vincula las tareas individuales con los objetivos institucionales, fortalece la motivación y el sentido de pertenencia.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n•\tFunción integradora: refuerza la identidad organizacional, los valores compartidos y la cohesión entre los integrantes. Al promover espacios de diálogo, intercambio de experiencias y trabajo colaborativo, contribuye a que las personas se reconozcan como parte de un proyecto colectivo con propósitos comunes.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n•\tFunción de control: posibilita el seguimiento, la verificación y la evaluación del cumplimiento de metas, estándares y compromisos organizacionales. A través de informes, indicadores y mecanismos de rendición de cuentas, permite detectar desviaciones y tomar decisiones correctivas de manera oportuna y fundamentada. "}},{"type":"group","name":"Grupo 1201837","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintHeight":true,"constraintBottom":true}},"id":"1760d606-3ec3-4c71-a5b8-a7f2c90ae8be","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":15846,"ty":-1493},"group":{"children":[{"type":"shape","name":"Rectángulo 454905","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_RECTANGLE","constraintWidth":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintBottom":true}},"id":"6159b5af-1c8a-4ee8-bae9-9f9fd29efcb4","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-23947,"ty":-7331},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":254,"g":221