cursos disponibles ","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":1094,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}]}},"id":"bd0e2397-22c3-44bc-8d17-297f15ffa934","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-2413,"ty":-2788.5},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24,"paragraphAlign":"center"}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":276},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":37,"x":-136.668701171875}],[{"y":39,"from":37,"to":69,"x":-114.49058532714844}],[{"y":63,"from":69,"to":105,"x":-126.10917663574219}],[{"y":87,"from":105,"to":140,"x":-121.93339538574219}],[{"y":111,"from":140,"to":178,"x":-128.44259643554688}],[{"y":135,"from":178,"to":217,"x":-135.24777221679688}],[{"y":159,"from":217,"to":256,"x":-135.7555694580078}],[{"y":183,"from":256,"to":276,"x":-67.23500061035156}]]}],"rawText":"Supone comparar cada opción a partir de los estándares de evaluación definidos previamente por el grupo. Este análisis estructurado permite jerarquizar las alternativas según su viabilidad, su impacto y su coherencia con los valores y recursos disponibles en la organización. "}},{"type":"text","name":"Una vez evaluadas las opciones, el equipo elige la que mejor responde a los parámetros definidos y diseña un plan de acción concreto. La implementación debe incluir responsables, tiempos y recursos claramente asignados para garantizar una ejecución efectiv","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleT